   "key": "f1040.line3a_if_ordinary",
   "record": "041680494df8e03e6bd412aadcf2c7abf0eaaa46e168438c3bbb4315d6cdf89f",
   "status": "DISAGREE",
   "ruling": "Ruling: representation; the candidate takes line 3a when line 3b is above zero, the project when box 1a is above zero (div.has_ordinary). Line 3b is Schedule B line 6, a copy of box 1a's gate line with the Schedule B refusals, so the two conditions agree wherever line 3b is not refused, and a refused line 3b refuses the return either way. i1040gi p. 25: \"Qualified dividends are also included in the ordinary dividend total required to be shown on line 3b\". Ruled by reading: the scoped reply names interfaces the candidate bank does not resolve, as in the earlier line-scoped passes of this lane.",
   "subject_key": "1fbcb8c1cd13078cacb8e644316451a191c888b9a33f12634d3cf282466e4b90"
  },
